{"id":"00013","root":"uni00013_1","name":{"ja":"甲河　アスカ","en":"Koukawa Asuka"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"甲河　アスカ","en":"Koukawa Asuka"},"element":"Science","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","roles":[],"traits":["Taimanin","UFS"],"release":"2018-09-25","limited":false,"characterId":13,"profile":{"ja":"孤高の抜け対魔忍。忍の名門・甲河家の若き当主であり唯一の生き残り。両親を含め一門をエドウィン・ブラックに殺され、アサギに引き取られて育てられる。１４の時には頭角を現し、対魔忍として認められてさくら、紫とともに危険な任務に投入され多くの戦果をあげる。しかし闇の勢力との死闘の中でアサギと対立、命令を無視してエドウィン・ブラックに単身挑むが敗北して両腕両脚に重傷を負い、その後失踪して抜け忍となる。長らく行方不明であった彼女だが、ある時、両腕に義手＜アンドロイド・アーム＞両脚に義足＜アンドロイド・レッグ＞を装着した姿で復活を果たし、人魔問わず闇の勢力に加担するものを次々と葬ってゆく事に。今ではアサギと並び、闇の者から鋼鉄の死神などと恐れられる存在となる。彼女の両腕の義手には、魔界の医療技術と人の科学技術が融合されたと思われる高度な技術が施されていて生身の腕のように自由自在に、機械アームのようにパワフルで精密に動き、様々な兵器も内蔵されていて、彼女を支える米連系の組織が存在する事が噂されているが定かではない。得物は両義手の中に仕込まれた鎌状の対魔ブレード。","en":"Koukawa Asuka is a lone, rogue Taimanin. As the young head of the noble Koukawa ninja clan and its sole survivor, she lost her entire family—including her parents—to Edwin Black, who was later taken in and raised by Asagi. At fourteen she rose to prominence, was recognized as a Taimanin, and was deployed alongside Sakura and Yatsu on dangerous missions, earning many victories. However, during a fierce battle against dark forces she clashed with Asagi, ignored orders, and challenged Edwin Black alone, only to be defeated and suffer severe injuries to both arms and legs. She vanished afterward, becoming a rogue ninja. After a long disappearance, she reappeared equipped with cybernetic arms and legs—android arms and legs—and began exterminating anyone, human or demon, who aided the darkness. Today she stands alongside Asagi, feared by the underworld as a \"steel reaper.\" Her prosthetic arms are said to combine Demon Realm medical technology with human science, granting them the freedom of flesh, the power and precision of machinery, and even built-in weaponry. Rumors suggest a U.S.-linked organization supports her, though this is unconfirmed. Her weapon is a scythe-like Taimanin blade hidden within the cyber arms."},"illustrator":"葵渚","voiceActor":"手塚りょうこ","forms":[{"id":"uni00013_1","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1186,2373],"sp":[150,150],"atk":[160,321],"def":[147,294],"spd":[63,63],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["5","42"]},{"id":"uni00013_2","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[1716,3433],"sp":[250,250],"atk":[245,491],"def":[219,439],"spd":[63,63],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["5","42","43"]},{"id":"uni00013_3","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","levelMax":100,"stats":{"hp":[2274,4547],"sp":[300,300],"atk":[330,662],"def":[291,583],"spd":[63,63],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["5","42","43","44"]}],"skills":{"5":{"slot":"attack","id":5,"name":null,"hits":1,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"科学属性ダメージ"}},{"level":2,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"科学属性ダメージ"}},{"level":3,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"科学属性ダメージ"}},{"level":4,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"科学属性ダメージ"}},{"level":5,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"科学属性ダメージ"}}],"effects":[{"text":"1 enemy: 100% Science damage","tag":"instant"}]},"42":{"slot":"skill1","id":42,"name":{"ja":"マッハパンチ"},"hits":3,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":150,"detail":{"ja":"ランダムな敵に極小威力で３回攻撃する"},"effects":[{"text":"Random enemies: 3 hits of 90% Science damage","tag":"instant"}]},{"level":2,"sp":150,"detail":{"ja":"ランダムな敵に極小威力で３回攻撃する"},"effects":[{"text":"Random enemies: 3 hits of 94% Science damage","tag":"instant"}]},{"level":3,"sp":150,"detail":{"ja":"ランダムな敵に極小威力で３回攻撃する"},"effects":[{"text":"Random enemies: 3 hits of 98% Science damage","tag":"instant"}]},{"level":4,"sp":150,"detail":{"ja":"ランダムな敵に極小威力で３回攻撃する"},"effects":[{"text":"Random enemies: 3 hits of 102% Science damage","tag":"instant"}]},{"level":5,"sp":150,"detail":{"ja":"ランダムな敵に極小威力で３回攻撃する"}}],"effects":[{"text":"Random enemies: 3 hits of 106% Science damage","tag":"instant"}]},"43":{"slot":"skill2","id":43,"name":{"ja":"忍法・風神・飛燕"},"hits":1,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":250,"detail":{"ja":"３ターンの間、味方全体のSPを中回復する"}},{"level":2,"sp":245,"detail":{"ja":"３ターンの間、味方全体のSPを中回復する"}},{"level":3,"sp":240,"detail":{"ja":"３ターンの間、味方全体のSPを中回復する"}},{"level":4,"sp":235,"detail":{"ja":"３ターンの間、味方全体のSPを中回復する"}},{"level":5,"sp":230,"detail":{"ja":"３ターンの間、味方全体のSPを中回復する"}}],"effects":[{"text":"All allies: SP regen 40 for 3 turns","icon":"Healing_sp","tag":"state","stack":"regen","ref":"st:2"}]},"44":{"slot":"ultimate","id":44,"name":{"ja":"忍法・風神・空陣"},"hits":4,"cutin":true,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":300,"detail":{"ja":"敵全体に中威力で攻撃する"},"effects":[{"text":"All enemies: 300% Science damage","tag":"instant"}]},{"level":2,"sp":300,"detail":{"ja":"敵全体に中威力で攻撃する"},"effects":[{"text":"All enemies: 302% Science damage","tag":"instant"}]},{"level":3,"sp":300,"detail":{"ja":"敵全体に中威力で攻撃する"},"effects":[{"text":"All enemies: 304% Science damage","tag":"instant"}]},{"level":4,"sp":300,"detail":{"ja":"敵全体に中威力で攻撃する"},"effects":[{"text":"All enemies: 306% Science damage","tag":"instant"}]},{"level":5,"sp":300,"detail":{"ja":"敵全体に中威力で攻撃する"}}],"effects":[{"text":"All enemies: 308% Science damage","tag":"instant"}]}},"leader":{"name":{"ja":"鋼鉄の対魔忍"},"detail":{"ja":"部隊全体のSPDを中アップ"},"effects":[{"text":"All allies: SPD +15%","icon":"spd_up","tag":"passive"}]},"abilities":[],"bloom":{"points":1,"gold":2,"status":1,"bonus":1,"items":[[1,"blo00003",40],[1,"ubl00013",50],[2,"blo00007",10],[2,"blo00008",10],[3,"blo00010",10],[3,"blo00011",10],[4,"blo00013",10],[4,"blo00014",10],[5,"blo00007",10],[5,"blo00008",10],[6,"blo00010",10],[6,"blo00011",10],[7,"blo00013",10],[7,"blo00014",10],[8,"blo00007",10],[8,"blo00008",10],[9,"blo00010",5],[9,"blo00011",15],[9,"blo00012",5],[10,"blo00007",5],[10,"blo00008",15],[10,"blo00009",5],[11,"blo00013",5],[11,"blo00014",15],[11,"blo00015",5],[12,"blo00003",80],[12,"ubl00013",100],[13,"blo00007",5],[13,"blo00008",15],[13,"blo00009",5],[14,"blo00010",5],[14,"blo00011",15],[14,"blo00012",5],[15,"blo00013",5],[15,"blo00014",15],[15,"blo00015",5],[16,"blo00007",5],[16,"blo00008",15],[16,"blo00009",5],[17,"blo00010",5],[17,"blo00011",15],[17,"blo00012",5],[18,"blo00013",5],[18,"blo00014",15],[18,"blo00015",5],[19,"blo00007",5],[19,"blo00008",15],[19,"blo00009",5],[20,"blo00011",10],[20,"blo00012",15],[21,"blo00008",10],[21,"blo00009",15],[22,"blo00014",10],[22,"blo00015",15],[23,"blo00011",10],[23,"blo00012",15],[24,"blo00008",10],[24,"blo00009",15],[25,"blo00014",10],[25,"blo00015",15],[26,"blo00003",30],[26,"ubl00013",50],[27,"blo00009",5],[27,"blo00012",5],[27,"blo00015",5],[28,"blo00009",5],[28,"blo00012",5],[28,"blo00015",5],[29,"blo00009",5],[29,"blo00012",5],[29,"blo00015",5],[30,"blo00009",5],[30,"blo00012",5],[30,"blo00015",5],[31,"blo00003",25],[31,"ubl00013",100],[32,"blo00009",5],[32,"blo00012",5],[32,"blo00015",5],[33,"blo00009",5],[33,"blo00012",5],[33,"blo00015",5],[34,"blo00009",5],[34,"blo00012",5],[34,"blo00015",5],[35,"blo00009",5],[35,"blo00012",5],[35,"blo00015",5],[36,"blo00003",50],[36,"ubl00013",50],[37,"blo00009",5],[37,"blo00012",5],[37,"blo00015",5],[38,"blo00009",5],[38,"blo00012",5],[38,"blo00015",5],[39,"blo00009",5],[39,"blo00012",5],[39,"blo00015",5],[40,"blo00009",5],[40,"blo00012",5],[40,"blo00015",5],[41,"blo00003",25],[41,"ubl00013",100],[42,"blo00009",5],[42,"blo00012",5],[42,"blo00015",5],[43,"blo00009",5],[43,"blo00012",5],[43,"blo00015",5],[44,"blo00009",5],[44,"blo00012",5],[44,"blo00015",5],[45,"blo00009",5],[45,"blo00012",5],[45,"blo00015",5],[46,"blo00003",50],[46,"ubl00013",50],[47,"blo00009",5],[47,"blo00012",5],[47,"blo00015",5],[48,"blo00009",5],[48,"blo00012",5],[48,"blo00015",5],[49,"blo00009",5],[49,"blo00012",5],[49,"blo00015",5],[50,"blo00009",5],[50,"blo00012",5],[50,"blo00015",5]]},"voices":[{"type":"new","label":"Acquired","variant":"base","index":1,"text":{"ja":"「甲河アスカよ。私の助けが必要なの？　仕方ないわね。そういう事なら、手伝ってあげてもいいわよ」","en":"Koukawa Asuka. You need my help? Fine, I guess. If that's what you want, I'll help you."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00013_1/uni00013_1_new_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":1,"text":{"ja":"任務が始まるまで暇ね。どうする？　お茶でもいれる？","en":"I'm bored until the mission kicks off. What should we do? Want me to brew some tea?"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00013_1/uni00013_1_hom_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":2,"text":{"ja":"ちょっと、さっきからどこ見てるの？　ぼうっとするくらいなら、こっち見たらいいじゃない","en":"Hey, where have you been staring? If you're just zoning out, you could just look at me."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00013_1/uni00013_1_hom_2.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":3,"text":{"ja":"ほんっと、あなたって面倒事に巻き込まれるわよね。……ま、そういう危ないところもいいんだけど","en":"Honestly, you always get yourself into trouble… but I guess that reckless side is kind of appealing."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00013_1/uni00013_1_hom_3.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":4,"text":{"ja":"はぁ、なんだかやる気が出ないなぁ。ねぇ、ちょっと一緒に休憩しない？","en":"Sigh, I just can't get motivated. Hey, want to take a break together?"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00013_1/uni00013_1_hom_4.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":5,"text":{"ja":"もう、どこ触ってるの？　ほんと、油断も隙もないんだから……","en":"Ugh, what are you touching now? Seriously, you never give me a moment's peace…"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00013_1/uni00013_1_hom_5.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":6,"text":{"ja":"ほんと、あなたを助け出すのには苦労したわ。まさか、あんな事になるなんて……","en":"Honestly, it was a hassle rescuing you. I never imagined it would turn out like that…"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00013_1/uni00013_1_hom_6.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":7,"text":{"ja":"お願いだから今度から、あんな事にならないよう気をつけてね？　じゃないと、私の身体が持たないもの","en":"Please, from now on make sure this doesn't happen again, okay? Otherwise my body won't hold up."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00013_1/uni00013_1_hom_7.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00013_1/uni00013_1_atk_1.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00013_1/uni00013_1_atk_2.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":3,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00013_1/uni00013_1_atk_3.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00013_1/uni00013_1_dmg_1.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00013_1/uni00013_1_dmg_2.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":3,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00013_1/uni00013_1_dmg_3.ogg"},{"type":"evo","label":"Awakening","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00013_1/uni00013_1_evo_1.ogg"},{"type":"evo","label":"Awakening","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00013_1/uni00013_1_evo_2.ogg"},{"type":"lup","label":"Level Up","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00013_1/uni00013_1_lup_1.ogg"},{"type":"msr","label":"Mission","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00013_1/uni00013_1_msr_1.ogg"},{"type":"msr","label":"Mission","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00013_1/uni00013_1_msr_2.ogg"},{"type":"rdy","label":"Battle Start","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00013_1/uni00013_1_rdy_1.ogg"},{"type":"rdy","label":"Battle Start","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00013_1/uni00013_1_rdy_2.ogg"},{"type":"res","label":"Result","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00013_1/uni00013_1_res_1.ogg"},{"type":"wav","label":"Wave","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00013_1/uni00013_1_wav_1.ogg"}],"trust":[100,200],"scenes":[["chr_0013_1_r18"],["chr_0013_2_r18"]],"stills":[["chr_0013_1a_r18"],["chr_0013_2a_r18"]],"obtain":[{"kind":"exchange","title":null,"start":"2021-10-15","end":null},{"kind":"exchange","title":null,"start":"2022-09-01","end":"2022-11-30"},{"kind":"exchange","title":null,"start":"2023-09-01","end":"2023-11-30"}